        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "培养批次与活性观测",
          "html": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:14px\">试点整理20—30批、每批连续30天的培养资料，保留菌群或批次标识、活性测值、盐度、初始营养浓度及每次补给时间和剂量，统一活性测定方法。逐日活性是拟合目标，补给记录用于解释曲线变化。本例使用合成培养曲线，以第0—14日的15次观测拟合参数，第15—30日的16次观测评价后期预测。</p><div class=\"checklist\"><div class=\"cl-head\"><span>数据准备清单 · 5 项</span><span class=\"cl-prog\"><span id=\"cl-txt\">0 / 5</span><span class=\"cl-bar\"><i id=\"cl-fill\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"0\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--card)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">微生物与生化指标</span><span class=\"cl-s\">菌浓、代谢产物、pH</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">按周取样</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"1\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--card)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">注入与产出</span><span class=\"cl-s\">营养液、产量、含水</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">日度</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"2\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--card)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">矿场试验</span><span class=\"cl-s\">增油量</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">少量真值</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"3\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--card)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">人工复核记录</span><span class=\"cl-s\">保留复核对象、原始证据与修订结论</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">连续30天活性、盐度、营养及补给记录</span></div><div class=\"cl-item\" data-cl=\"4\"><span class=\"cl-box\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--card)\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5\"/></svg></span><span><span class=\"cl-t\">样本版本与评价明细</span><span class=\"cl-s\">按原始对象分组，保留评价记录与版本</span></span><span class=\"cl-n\">用于复查数值和追踪更新</span></div></div><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">专业资料与数据依据</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1612.04663\">Landa-Marbán等：MEOR机理模型原论文<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "参数辨识与批次差异",
          "html": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:2px\"><span class=\"dtag\" data-d=\"高\">难度 高</span><span class=\"small muted\">早期观测难区分生长与衰亡，培养批次差异明显</span></div><div class=\"meter\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on hi\"></i></div><p>主要难点是较短的早期曲线可能由多组生长和衰亡参数解释，盐度、营养及菌群状态变化又会放大后期差异。试点应保留重复培养和批次信息，在营养消耗转折附近加密观测，检查相同条件下活性测值的一致性。候选补给时机依赖拟合参数，实验人员需要重点比较不同批次的参数稳定性和补给后的实际响应。</p><p style=\"margin-top:18px\"><span class=\"kicker plain\" style=\"color:var(--ink-4)\">可借鉴的通用技术</span></p><div class=\"refs\"><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/ts\">小样本学习<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/ts\">机理—数据混合建模<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/method/ts\">软测量<span class=\"ar\">↗</span></a></div>"
        }
      ]
